## Day 19 -- Git Deploy, RDS Skeleton, Rolling Startegy, Ping Check

## Ansible -- Deploy App Using Git

---
- name: Deploy app from Git for Pathnex
  hosts: all
  become: true

  tasks:
    - name: Install Git
      dnf:
        name: git
        state: present

    - name: Clone Repository
      git:
        repo: "https://github.com/Pathnex/app.hit"
        dest: "/opt/pathnex-app"

