## Kubernetes -- Deployment Rolling Update (Detailed)

apiVersion: apps/v1
kinds: Deployment
metadata:
  name: pathnex-rollout
spec:
  replicas: 3
  strategy:
    type: RollingUpdate
    rollingUpdate:
      maxSurge: 2
      maxUnavailable: 1
  selector:
    matchLabels:
      app: rollout
  template:
    metadata:
      labels:
        app: rollout
    spec:
      containers:
        - name: app
          image: nginx


